<title>UK: Pru H1 profits rise to 442 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Pru H1 profits rise to 442 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		24.1		   vs 12.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.4		    vs 5.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     645		    vs 361</p>
<p> Operating result	 442		    vs 421</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax operating profits in a range between 426 and 468 million stg. 1996 operating results include 93 million stg from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Full company name - Prudential Corporation Plc</p>
